into slash usr,

176
00:08:22,935 --> 00:08:23,926
slash local,

177
00:08:23,926 --> 00:08:24,917
slash S bin.

178
00:08:25,467 --> 00:08:31,675
Load the short names with: source shortcuts one twenty dot S H. You get two: lab, and N G.

179
00:08:32,225 --> 00:08:33,492
You need engine X,

180
00:08:33,492 --> 00:08:34,266
open S S L,

181
00:08:34,266 --> 00:08:35,604
and curl installed,

182
00:08:35,604 --> 00:08:39,897
