00:08:53,257 --> 00:08:55,326
Pass or fail. You need all five.

190
00:08:55,876 --> 00:08:58,991
A valid key and certificate for local host exist.

191
00:08:59,541 --> 00:09:02,506
The config passes the test, and engine X runs.

192
00:09:03,056 --> 00:09:06,192
H T T P S answers with the CloudCart page.

